{
  "name": "Your Lead Response and WhatsApp Follow-Up System",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 1 - A LEAD WRITES IN\n\nWeb form, Instagram DM or Facebook DM all land on one webhook, get cleaned into the same shape, and are saved in Supabase before anything else runs.",
        "height": 820,
        "width": 700,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "b5ebf427-a7d8-5b30-bc89-0d2c7c8c8bd4",
      "name": "Section - 1 - A LEAD WRITES IN",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -60,
        -120
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 2 - INSTANT ALERT AND FIRST REPLY\n\nThe team hears about the lead in Slack, and the lead gets a WhatsApp reply with a booking link, both within seconds of writing in.",
        "height": 820,
        "width": 460,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "ac59e510-8064-53e3-8f22-38b3a33f2670",
      "name": "Section - 2 - INSTANT ALERT AND FIRST REPLY",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        800,
        -120
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 3 - FOLLOW UP UNTIL BOOKED\n\nOne day later it checks Supabase. Booked or replied means confirm and put it on the calendar. Silence means a gentle nudge, wait two days, check again.",
        "height": 820,
        "width": 940,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "a7258cb2-6685-5110-ace8-eb0d4a3a17f0",
      "name": "Section - 3 - FOLLOW UP UNTIL BOOKED",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1420,
        -120
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 4 - WHEN THEY REPLY ON WHATSAPP\n\nTwilio posts the inbound message back in. The model reads it and routes it: book the time, hand a real question to a human, or stop messaging them for good.",
        "height": 820,
        "width": 1040,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "27856d1c-fd80-509c-be85-5eddd33c79fe",
      "name": "Section - 4 - WHEN THEY REPLY ON WHATSAPP",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        2520,
        -120
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 5 - NOTHING FAILS QUIETLY\n\nIf any step in the flow errors, Slack gets the lead, the step and a link to the failed run, so a silent break never costs a booking.",
        "height": 820,
        "width": 460,
        "color": 1
      },
      "id": "78b8dee8-686b-5828-b4c9-e1e2919e4019",
      "name": "Section - 5 - NOTHING FAILS QUIETLY",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        3720,
        -120
      ]
    },
    {
